ysiQyujq4EPnjj20ed0xAd40wg&oe=69F1E52A"}, {"file_name": "Manhattan.png", "id": "769749561031819", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031354_769749564365152_719504838779110501_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UsMA19ojg2sQ7kNvwHeW4pq&_nc_oc=AdoVn1EjEeovoehZjPtUQM7dEICc2Ioiyd8XYG7saGe724H04n3znYzyMDW82COGRg0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0ISlx58jtRyTGgs2bvvZmTJ6szrF0X3T5JQgH7sSkItg&oe=69F1F991"}, {"file_name": "Night.png", "id": "1110661989540801", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569445_1110661992874134_6298588856526033181_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SUkk0R3Wco0Q7kNvwHZ-AkU&_nc_oc=Adrk8J9VylYF7OvxjegfUmgHin4FjXfMw6mslT-PNtx625n3eFaSJKitzkVxMv1-7gQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2OrzH9MX9QYaSkUVIPQ7AlmuGs4zUqY7BvDRIWbjbEgg&oe=69F21552"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape.png", "id": "1246961292499404", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974593_1246961295832737_6945312466061911653_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K77dEfoSRGEQ7kNvwFHIi_h&_nc_oc=AdpkMHD8S2KGXTmoiPHIDyvecv3U6ObJUeKY-Kh4VLLwjhG48ICfPEzfmp_-NTLDi34&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1w6AdUcQ0TVVxk8e-qenGWRU_o4ehejddYxb71GXtGeQ&oe=69F1EC45"}, "display_name": "World Flight", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Fly around the world without limits with your Meta Quest 2 headset.\n\nFeel the freedom, travel anywhere in the planet and enjoy all its beauty and diversity.\n\n[Internet connection required]\n\nFeatures:\n- Plan your flight on the map with a powerful search engine\n- Fly a plane or a helicopter with totally different gameplays\n- Dynamic weather, wind and time of day \n- Procedurally generated buildings and water with real data\n- Enjoy some of the most famous landmarks\n- Fully interactive cockpits\n- Manage fuel, wind, flaps, landing gear and brakes\n- Take off and land at any airport/heliport in the world", "short_description": "Fly around the world without limits with your Meta Quest 2 headset.\n\nFeel the freedom, travel anywhere in the planet and enjoy all its beauty and diversity.\n\n- Plan your flight on the map with a powerful search engine\n- Fly a plane or a helicopter with totally different gameplays\n- Dynamic weather, wind and time of day \n- Procedurally generated buildings and water with real data\n- Enjoy some of the most famous landmarks\n- Fully interactive cockpits\n- Manage fuel, wind, flaps, landing gear... etc"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1046968962646370", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "World Flight", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Vuela alrededor del mundo sin l\u00edmites con tu casco Meta Quest 2.\n\nSiente la libertad, viaja a cualquier parte del planeta y disfruta de toda su belleza y diversidad.\n\n[Requiere conexi\u00f3n a Internet]\n\nCaracter\u00edsticas:\n- Planifica tu vuelo en el mapa con un potente motor de b\u00fasqueda\n- Vuela un avi\u00f3n o un helic\u00f3ptero con modos de juego totalmente diferentes\n- Tiempo din\u00e1mico, viento y hora del d\u00eda.\n- Edificios y agua generados procesalmente con datos reales\n- Disfruta de algunos de los lugares m\u00e1s famosos.\n- Cabinas completamente interactivas\n- Administrar combustible, viento, flaps, tren de aterrizaje y frenos\n- Despegar y aterrizar en cualquier aeropuerto/helipuerto del mundo", "short_description": "Vuela alrededor del mundo sin l\u00edmites con tu casco Meta Quest 2.\n\nSiente la libertad, viaja a cualquier parte del planeta y disfruta de toda su belleza y diversidad.\n\n- Planifica tu vuelo en el mapa con un potente motor de b\u00fasqueda\n- Vuela un avi\u00f3n o un helic\u00f3ptero con modos de juego totalmente diferentes\n- Tiempo din\u00e1mico, viento y hora del d\u00e